{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>עלות</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other in (I Samuel 7) פרות עלות. And in David: מאחר עלות הביאו. And the other: ובחקו ישא עלות ינהל. Our Rabbis of blessed memory said: King David and Jacob would have compassion on the flocks and graze them in soft pasture, therefore it says here עלות, and in David מאחר עלות הביאו. And what would they do? Like a shepherd — עררו ירעה."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:41.866528551Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}